# Scenario: what the developer tools change survives the game's own save and load (M11.1a, docs/M11_PLAN.md
# section 17), part 1: event flags of several kinds (a counter, a quest's, a boss's defeat through the story's
# steps), the money and an item's count changed with the tools; the game's own SAVE (the system menu); back to the
# title and CONTINUE -- the game reads its save again; the same values read back. tests/devtools_suite.py compares
# the answers before the save and after the load, then runs part 2 (devtools_persist_load: a new process continuing
# from this run's saves). No death (the tools') so a passing enemy never ends the run.
# Starts from: the kept checkpoint castle-front.
#! saves build/checkpoints/castle-front
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 600

include common.drive

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0,area==17 90
sleep 3
dev nodeath on
dev progress
dev flag set 145 9
dev flag set 221 5
dev flag set 250 1
dev progress set 4
dev money 1234
dev count 10 23
dev flags 0 330
dev items
dev player
dev progress
call system_save
call to_title_and_continue
state life>0 90
sleep 3
dev flags 0 330
dev items
dev player
dev progress
